<title>USA: Bergen Brunswig wins 5-year, $330 mln deal.</title>
<headline>Bergen Brunswig wins 5-year, $330 mln deal.</headline>
<dateline>ORANGE, Calif. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bergen Brunswig Corp on Tuesday said it has signed a five-year drug distribution agreement with BJC Health System.</p>
<p>In a statement, Bergen expects to generate about $330 million in sales over the contract's life.</p>
<p>BJC is the the second largest, non-profit healthcare system in the United States with 13 member hospitals, six long-term care facilities and more than 100 academic and community-based sites.</p>
</text>
